msgid "Set :ref:`GCS_PID_MASK <GCS_PID_MASK>` to 2 (Throttle) to send PID information to the ground station"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-process.rst:28
#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-process.rst:43
#: 8540cd2a88ea42b796b59f5a6cf5e6ac
